WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:03.912
Welcome to the US time tracking training.

00:00:03.912 --> 00:00:08.597
Every hour you work should show up on your paycheck, exactly as you worked it.

00:00:09.947 --> 00:00:14.205
Time tracking simply means recording the hours you work, every day.

00:00:14.205 --> 00:00:19.227
It is how Cisco processes payroll accurately, and stays in line with labor law.

00:00:20.577 --> 00:00:22.365
Here is what you will cover.

00:00:22.365 --> 00:00:24.090
Who tracks time, and where.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.048
Why it matters.

00:00:25.048 --> 00:00:27.922
The policy on timecards, breaks and overtime.

00:00:27.922 --> 00:00:28.816
The deadlines.

00:00:28.816 --> 00:00:31.243
And the alerts that keep you on track.

00:00:32.593 --> 00:00:33.819
You track your own time.

00:00:33.819 --> 00:00:38.417
This course takes about thirty minutes, and gives you everything you need to get it right.
